WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The original version of the iron frame diagram is too demanding, but simplify it.

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,760
Even if only 30% of the strength

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,000
It's enough to make these pricks completely reborn.

4
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:10,750
This is my team, my starting point

5
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,520
Wait for them to take shape

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,720
The real iron frame picture is not far away, boss.

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,120
Is what you said true?

8
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,230
What's the benefit of lying to you?

9
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:27,890
So do you want to try it? Of course you want to try it.

10
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,770
Who doesn’t want to become stronger? Think clearly.

11
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,690
If you really practice it, it will be very hard.

12
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:39,180
I don’t mean to back down here. It’s just training. How hard can it be? Boss, if I just train here, I can’t kill anyone.

13
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,900
Then train me to death. I won't be afraid at all.

14
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:41,940
What does it mean to endure hardship?

15
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,340
I've been with this thing in my life

16
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,050
Mr. Qin, please train me as much as you can

17
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:48,370
I hope you can really carry it as you say

18
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,060
Why is the boss's smile so cautious all of a sudden?

19
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:53,680
Obviously smiling

20
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:56,440
Why do I feel colder than when I said I was going to endure hardship just now?
